HTTP 200 {"id":4,"total":10000,"status":"placed"}
--- alice GET bob's order via /orders/{id}
HTTP 200 {"id":4,"user_id":2,"product_id":1,"quantity":1,"total":10000,"status":"placed","created_at":"2026-09-26 03:18:00"}
--- bob GET bob's order via /orders/{id}
HTTP 200 {"id":4,"user_id":2,"product_id":1,"quantity":1,"total":10000,"status":"placed","created_at":"2026-09-26 03:18:00"}

